{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Curse Of Slimetopia",
    "steam_appid": 3208380,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure to asend to the top of slimeciety and cure the world of a curse to keep the hierarchy in place! You take control of a humanoid slime who is trying to overcome their own insecurities while saving all slimes from a grim and pre-destined life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208380/extras/dac28f4d5c40552a21372c8ae1de3fa8.avif?t=1753374369\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an alien yet familiar world inhabited by slimes and other creatures. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Ascend from near the bottom to the very top of the capital city named Slimetopia, uncovering the story behind how slimeciety was built and preserved. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Overcome the past and defy the future in your journey. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Precision platforming using either Keyboard and Mouse <strong>OR</strong> Controller.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Many platforming skills, some of which you unlock as you progress including; Walljump, Double Jump, Ground Stomp and Recoil Jump. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Use the enviroment to your advantage navigate levels quicker. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hidden collectables in levels to unlock a <i>HardMode</i> version of the level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208380/extras/0c0bae970f03ee4b24b469d5ca19f0e3.avif?t=1753374369\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in a <i>very early state</i>. While the base mechanics are in (barring a few tweaks from feedback), expect to see:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potential additional mechanics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An overhaul of some of the art + all new art. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A more suitable soundscape.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional songs. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Additional levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A more fleshed out story with additional cutscenes and dialouges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Localization for multiple different languages.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure to asend to the top of slimeciety and cure the world of a curse to keep the hierarchy in place! You take control of a humanoid slime who is trying to overcome their own insecurities while saving all slimes from a grim and pre-destined life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208380/extras/dac28f4d5c40552a21372c8ae1de3fa8.avif?t=1753374369\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an alien yet familiar world inhabited by slimes and other creatures. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Ascend from near the bottom to the very top of the capital city named Slimetopia, uncovering the story behind how slimeciety was built and preserved. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Overcome the past and defy the future in your journey. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Precision platforming using either Keyboard and Mouse <strong>OR</strong> Controller.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Many platforming skills, some of which you unlock as you progress including; Walljump, Double Jump, Ground Stomp and Recoil Jump. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Use the enviroment to your advantage navigate levels quicker. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hidden collectables in levels to unlock a <i>HardMode</i> version of the level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208380/extras/0c0bae970f03ee4b24b469d5ca19f0e3.avif?t=1753374369\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in a <i>very early state</i>. While the base mechanics are in (barring a few tweaks from feedback), expect to see:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potential additional mechanics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An overhaul of some of the art + all new art. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A more suitable soundscape.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional songs. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Additional levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A more fleshed out story with additional cutscenes and dialouges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Localization for multiple different languages.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Embark on an adventure to asend to the top of slimeciety and cure the world of a curse to keep the hierarchy in place! A 2D precision platformer where you take control of a humanoid slime who's trying to overcome their own insecurities while saving all slimes from a grim and pre-destined life.",
